Description: fate/h264: test SEI payload header bounds
 Add a FATE reference covering those failures, the maximum signed type,
 ordinary extended headers and truncation.
 .
 Signed-off-by: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
 .
 Port to 9.0.2: libavcodec/Makefile and tests/fate/libavcodec.mak: the lines are added at the same place in the list, 9.0.2 has other neighbours there.
